{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/address-grand-nshama-downtown-dubai","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":62,"crm_id":"4518","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Address Grand","slug":"address-grand-nshama-downtown-dubai","display_address":"Downtown Dubai","building_type":["apartment","duplex","branded"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Nshama","price":10860000,"display_price":"10.86M","lattitude":25.1934666,"longitude":55.2774039,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Address Grand Downtown by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-nshama/\">Nshama </a>is an epitome of elegance in <strong>Downtown Dubai,</strong> offering exquisite <strong>3 to 5-bedroom apartments and duplexes. </strong>This prestigious 55-story residential tower features 80 exclusive residences, designed for those who value sophistication and prime location. The Address Grand Downtown offers unparalleled views: one side frames the Burj Khalifa and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/downtown-dubai/\">Downtown Dubai</a>, while the other provides serene sea views, blending vibrant energy with tranquil escape.&nbsp;</p><p>Its tiered design creates dynamic contours, making it a standout in Dubai’s skyline. Every residence is crafted as a private sanctuary with expansive ceilings, retractable glass walls, and seamless indoor-outdoor integration. Thoughtful layouts, premium materials, and impeccable design enhance luxury living. Interiors reflect refined minimalism with custom furnishings, intricate detailing, and an exclusive retreat ambiance.</p><p>Luxury extends to marble flooring, built-in wood veneer cabinets, lavish wardrobes, and spa-like bathrooms with soaking tubs an